    "config.the-nothing-mod.crashes.name":  "Allow intentional crashes",
    "config.the-nothing-mod.crashes.description":  "Now and then (a couple of times per world at most, never in the first half hour of play) the game may crash on purpose. The world is saved first and nothing is lost; you just start the game again. Turn this off and it never happens.",
