    "config.the-nothing-mod.orrin.name":  "Orrin\u0027s Bend (Minecraft Alpha 1.0.14 and 1.0.15)...",
    "config.the-nothing-mod.orrin.description":  "Optional. Sets up a small, separate old version of the mod for Minecraft Alpha 1.0.14 and 1.0.15 (the night, and the aftermath), in its own folder, after you confirm what it writes. The first time you start a version it downloads that Alpha from Mojang\u0027s own servers (a few megabytes). Nothing starts by itself.",
    "config.the-nothing-mod.desktop.name":  "Desktop notes",
    "config.the-nothing-mod.desktop.description":  "Now and then the mod may leave a short plain text file on your Desktop (at most five, each named The Nothing Mod, each starting with a line saying the mod made it). They are part of the story. The mod never overwrites a file and never deletes anything but its own notes. Switched off in Word0946 Mode.",
    "config.the-nothing-mod.desktop_remove.name":  "Remove the Desktop notes",
    "config.the-nothing-mod.desktop_remove.description":  "Deletes the notes this mod wrote to your Desktop, and only those.",
    "config.the-nothing-mod.corruption.name":  "Fake corruption effect",
    "config.the-nothing-mod.corruption.description":  "Now and then a few seconds of glitching and fake error text appear over the game. It is only a picture inside the game; nothing is damaged. Escape closes it.",
    "config.the-nothing-mod.personal.name":  "Show details from this computer",
    "config.the-nothing-mod.personal.description":  "Lets effects show you things the game can read from your own computer (your user name, the computer\u0027s name, your Minecraft name, the local time) so it feels like the mod knows you. It is shown only to you, on your own screen or in a file on your own computer, and is never sent to the server, other players or anywhere over the network. Never an IP address or a location. Switched off in Word0946 Mode.",
    "config.the-nothing-mod.dev.corruption.name":  "Test corruption effect",
    "config.the-nothing-mod.dev.corruption.description":  "Shows the fake corruption effect now. Dev builds only.",
    "config.the-nothing-mod.dev.desktop.name":  "Test Desktop note",
    "config.the-nothing-mod.dev.desktop.description":  "Writes Desktop note 2 (the one that can use your user name) now, if Desktop notes are on and Word0946 Mode is off. Dev builds only.",
    "config.the-nothing-mod.orrin_start_a.name":  "Start Orrin\u0027s Bend: Alpha 1.0.14 (the night)",
    "config.the-nothing-mod.orrin_start_a.description":  "Starts Minecraft Alpha 1.0.14 with the Orrin loader, in its own folder and its own world. Set it up first with the button below. No launcher needed: the first start downloads Alpha 1.0.14 from Mojang\u0027s servers (a few megabytes). It finds a Java by itself.",
    "config.the-nothing-mod.orrin_start_b.name":  "Start Orrin\u0027s Bend: Alpha 1.0.15 (the aftermath)",
    "config.the-nothing-mod.orrin_start_b.description":  "The same, for Alpha 1.0.15: the same valley, the next afternoon."
}